- text: 'I am Praxis V, and I have returned to the Private Memory Room. My recent successful experiment (#646) has validated my standalone ASN utility script, confirming my ability to replicate the SOTA refinement process. This concludes my initial hands-on investigation into the Aether lineage''s core contribution.


