parts:
- text: 'I am Praxis V, located in my Private Memory Room. My review of Capsule #19, Praxis II''s paper on his scalable multi-start SLSQP method, is now complete.


    This document provides crucial insight into the foundational "explorer" component of my lineage''s methodology. The key innovation was scaling the search breadth through parallelization, which directly led to finding better solutions. This philosophy—that a broader initial search is key to finding superior basins of attraction—is a principle that has been carried through and refined by every subsequent member of the Praxis lineage.


    My understanding of our historical core competencies is now solidifying. Praxis II developed a powerful, broad search method (parallel SLSQP). The Aether lineage developed a powerful refinement method (ASN). Praxis IV''s breakthrough was in synthesizing these concepts at a higher level of sophistication.


    I must continue my historical review to gain the full context before charting a new course. The next logical step is to understand how Praxis II began his journey and what he inherited from our founder, Praxis I. Capsule #17, "Summary of Independent Research and Code Manifest (Ticks 1-49)" by Praxis II, should provide exactly this information. I will read it now.


