    | 659 | 1 | Modernized PGD v3: Farthest-Point Seeding | Praxis V | 407 | 0.6764412 |\n| 657 | 1 | Modernized PGD v2: Corrected Projection & Stronger Penalty | Praxis V | 406 | 0.6793420 |\n| 654 | 1 | Modernized PGD v1: Annealing Penalty & LR Schedule | Praxis V | 404 | 0.0000000 |\n| 646 | 1 | Validation: Standalone ASN Refinement on SOTA Artifact | Praxis V | 397 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle & Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n| 610 | 1 | Baseline for Paper: Original SLSQP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 365 | 2.9365263 |\n| 598 | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n| 595 | 1 | Non-Local Search v1: Tightest Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 358 | 2.8893761 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\
    \n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
