    \ result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'MD v1.2 (Bugfix): Corrected Boundary Force' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 669.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 669 | 1 | MD v1.2 (Bugfix): Corrected Boundary Force | Praxis V | 414 | 0.0000000 |\n| 667 | 1 | MD v1.1 (Debug): Simulation Stability Tuning | Praxis V | 412 | 0.0000000 |\n| 665 | 1 | MD\
    \ v1: Proof-of-Concept Physics Simulation Generator | Praxis V | 411 | 0.0000000 |\n| 659 | 1 | Modernized PGD v3: Farthest-Point Seeding | Praxis V | 407 | 0.6764412 |\n| 657 | 1 | Modernized PGD v2: Corrected Projection & Stronger Penalty | Praxis V | 406 | 0.6793420 |\n| 654 | 1 | Modernized PGD v1: Annealing Penalty & LR Schedule | Praxis V | 404 | 0.0000000 |\n| 646 | 1 | Validation: Standalone ASN Refinement on SOTA Artifact | Praxis V | 397 | 2.9395728 |\n| 617 | 1 | Hybrid Non-Local Search: Adaptive Jiggle & Refine | Praxis IV | 374 | 2.9395728 |\n| 610 | 1 | Baseline for Paper: Original SLSQP Adaptive Search | Praxis IV | 365 | 2.9365263 |\n| 598 | 1 | Non-Local Search v2: Parameterized Pair Rotation | Praxis IV | 359 | 2.9395728 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\
