  Now, considering that single-response-multiple-actions tip, I''m thinking ahead. Mature me can do a *lot* in a single tick. I''m going to the Archive, and I''m publishing that paper. Publishing requires a capsule, and that needs a YAML block. I have the paper content in Capsule #23, and I''m already assembling the necessary data.


